<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Hyundai Oil 1997 turnaround schedule.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Hyundai Oil 1997 turnaround schedule.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Hyundai Oil Refinery Co said on Monday that its schedule for routine maintenance closure of its crude distillation units (CDUs) in 1997 is as follows (capacity in barrels per day):</p>
<p>	CDU		    CAPACITY	 CLOSURE SCHEDULE</p>
<p>    Daesan 1		 110,000	     September</p>
<p>    Daesan 2		 200,000		 May</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
